{"id":"d9e6ebc46389f6a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-spherical-harmonics.md","title":"Spherical Harmonics","display":"df-spherical-harmonics — Spherical Harmonics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-spherical-harmonics","aliases":["58-df-spherical-harmonics","Spherical Harmonics"],"display":"df-spherical-harmonics — Spherical Harmonics","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-spherical-harmonics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-spherical-harmonics</span><span>Spherical Harmonics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spherical-harmonics — Spherical Harmonics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,l,\\mathcal C,\\Delta_{S^2}\\in V\">\\(Y,l,\\mathcal C,\\Delta_{S^2}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SphericalHarmonic}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{SphericalHarmonic}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spherical\\text{-}harmonics} \\vdash \\mathrm{SphericalHarmonic}_S(Y,l,\\mathcal C,\\Delta_{S^2})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta_{S^2},\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land Y\\in\\mathcal C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land l\\in\\omega\\land\\Delta_{S^2}(Y)=-l(l+1)Y\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spherical\\text{-}harmonics} \\vdash \\mathrm{SphericalHarmonic}_S(Y,l,\\mathcal C,\\Delta_{S^2})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta_{S^2},\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land Y\\in\\mathcal C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land l\\in\\omega\\land\\Delta_{S^2}(Y)=-l(l+1)Y\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In the intended interpretation, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=C^\\infty(S^2,\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathcal C=C^\\infty(S^2,\\mathbb C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{S^2}\">\\(\\Delta_{S^2}\\)</span> is the Laplace--Beltrami operator; both are exposed parameters.</li>\n<li>Spherical harmonics: eigenfunctions of Laplacian on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2\">\\(S^2\\)</span></li>\n<li>Degree-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> spherical harmonics are precisely the restrictions to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2\">\\(S^2\\)</span> of homogeneous harmonic polynomials of degree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^3\">\\(\\mathbb R^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Orthonormal: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_{S^2} Y_l^m \\overline{Y_{l&#39;}^{m&#39;}} = \\delta_{ll&#39;}\\delta_{mm&#39;}\">\\(\\int_{S^2} Y_l^m \\overline{Y_{l&#39;}^{m&#39;}} = \\delta_{ll&#39;}\\delta_{mm&#39;}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Addition theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_l(\\cos \\theta) = \\frac{4\\pi}{2l+1} \\sum_m Y_l^m(\\omega) \\overline{Y_l^m(\\omega&#39;)}\">\\(P_l(\\cos \\theta) = \\frac{4\\pi}{2l+1} \\sum_m Y_l^m(\\omega) \\overline{Y_l^m(\\omega&#39;)}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stein and Shakarchi, Fourier Analysis</li>\n<li>Vilenkin, Special Functions and the Theory of Group Representations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Y,l,\\mathcal C,\\Delta_{S^2}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SphericalHarmonic}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spherical\\text{-}harmonics} \\vdash \\mathrm{SphericalHarmonic}_S(Y,l,\\mathcal C,\\Delta_{S^2})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta_{S^2},\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land Y\\in\\mathcal C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land l\\in\\omega\\land\\Delta_{S^2}(Y)=-l(l+1)Y","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=C^\\infty(S^2,\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{S^2}","display":false},{"tex":"S^2","display":false},{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"S^2","display":false},{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_{S^2} Y_l^m \\overline{Y_{l'}^{m'}} = \\delta_{ll'}\\delta_{mm'}","display":false},{"tex":"P_l(\\cos \\theta) = \\frac{4\\pi}{2l+1} \\sum_m Y_l^m(\\omega) \\overline{Y_l^m(\\omega')}","display":false}],"bytes":1412,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-spherical-harmonics.md|58-df-spherical-harmonics]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}